{"id":"en_beyond-the-law","title":"Beyond the Law","titleEn":"Beyond the Law","description":"Edward Lawson has never lost a case defending the wealthy, so taking on a billionaire’s son as a client seems routine. Then, shortly before the trial, an unforeseen conflict leaves members of his own family hospitalized. Lawson turns against his client, secures the young man’s conviction, and instantly becomes the billionaire’s next target. Framed with help from a former student, he is disbarred and imprisoned. Together with other lawyers, he pieces together the setup, regains his freedom and clears his name. Now victims seek him out, and he agrees to represent them with a promise of justice, even as a fresh threat follows close behind his car. Beyond the Law can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/beyond-the-law/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/beyond-the-law/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Office Politics","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_beyond-the-law_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beyond-the-law_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beyond-the-law_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_beyond-the-law_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-